  "__class__": "Meeting",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": "00:09:40.610",
      "end": "00:09:41.590",
      "text": "Good afternoon colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": "00:09:41.590",
      "end": "00:09:46.200",
      "text": "I'm going to call the 13th meeting of the Corporate Services Committee to order."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": "00:09:46.200",
      "end": "00:09:50.730",
      "text": "This is a special meeting that has been added to the agenda."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": "00:09:50.730",
      "end": "00:09:54.040",
      "text": "And I want to begin by acknowledging that the City of London is situated on the traditional"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": "00:09:54.040",
      "end": "00:09:59.380",
      "text": "lands of the Anishinaabek, the Haudenosaunee, the Leni Paywalk, and the Adawanda and Peoples."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": "00:09:59.380",
      "end": "00:10:03.840",
      "text": "And we honor and respect the history, languages, and culture of the diverse indigenous people"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": "00:10:03.840",
      "end": "00:10:05.770",
      "text": "who call this territory home."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": "00:10:05.770",
      "end": "00:10:10.780",
      "text": "The City of London is currently home to many First Nations, M\u00e9tis, and Inuit."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": "00:10:10.780",
      "end": "00:10:13.780",
      "text": "And as representatives of the people of the City of London, we are grateful to have the"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": "00:10:13.780",
      "end": "00:10:16.470",
      "text": "opportunity to work and live in this territory."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": "00:10:16.470",
      "end": "00:10:21.060",
      "text": "The City of London is also committed to making every effort to provide alternate formats and"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": "00:10:21.060",
      "end": "00:10:24.130",
      "text": "communication supports for meetings upon request."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": "00:10:24.130",
      "end": "00:10:35.930",
      "text": "To make a request specific to this meeting, please contact csc@london.ca or phone 519-661-2489"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": "00:10:35.930",
      "end": "00:10:40.460",
      "text": "extension 2425."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": "00:10:40.460",
      "end": "00:10:41.600",
      "text": "This is a special meeting."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": "00:10:41.600",
      "end": "00:10:46.820",
      "text": "It is only a one item agenda colleagues, but I do first have to call for any disclosures"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": "00:10:46.820",
      "end": "00:10:51.090",
      "text": "of pecuniary interest, seeing none."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": "00:10:51.090",
      "end": "00:10:55.740",
      "text": "We have no consent items, no scheduled items, no items for direction, no deferred matters"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": "00:10:55.740",
      "end": "00:10:59.330",
      "text": "or additional business, just one item in confidential session."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": "00:10:59.330",
      "end": "00:11:02.380",
      "text": "So I'm going to look for Councilor Trussow."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": "00:11:02.380",
      "end": "00:11:06.670",
      "text": "I'd like to make a motion that we go into confidential session for the purposes of discussing"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": "00:11:06.670",
      "end": "00:11:10.350",
      "text": "the labor relations."
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": "00:11:10.350",
      "end": "00:11:11.310",
      "text": "Thank you for moving that."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": "00:11:11.310",
      "end": "00:11:13.570",
      "text": "And we've got a seconder in Councilor Ferreira."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": "00:11:13.570",
      "end": "00:11:15.560",
      "text": "So we'll just get the clerk to open the vote on that."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": "00:11:15.560",
      "end": "00:11:46.150",
      "text": "And then we can move into confidential session."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": "00:11:46.150",
      "end": "00:11:54.500",
      "text": "Fosing the vote motion carries six to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": "00:11:54.500",
      "end": "00:11:55.480",
      "text": "Thank you colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": "00:11:55.480",
      "end": "00:11:58.900",
      "text": "We will just wait until we get chambers secured and then we'll proceed with our agenda item."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": "00:11:58.900",
      "end": "00:15:06.180",
      "text": "All right, the clerk advises."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": "00:15:06.180",
      "end": "00:15:09.930",
      "text": "We are ready to proceed back in public session."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": "00:15:09.930",
      "end": "00:15:15.060",
      "text": "So I will ask Councilor Trussow as our vice chair to report out."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": "00:15:15.060",
      "end": "00:15:20.980",
      "text": "At the June 20th, 2023, Special Corporate Services Committee, the committee considered"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": "00:15:20.980",
      "end": "00:15:28.050",
      "text": "a confidential matter pertaining to an identifiable individual, particularly an employment-related"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": "00:15:28.050",
      "end": "00:15:32.670",
      "text": "matter and progress was made."
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": "00:15:32.670",
      "end": "00:15:34.640",
      "text": "Thank you, Mr. Vice Chair."
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": "00:15:34.640",
      "end": "00:15:36.310",
      "text": "Colleagues, that concludes our agenda."
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": "00:15:36.310",
      "end": "00:15:38.290",
      "text": "We just need a motion to adjourn."
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": "00:15:38.290",
      "end": "00:15:41.320",
      "text": "We'll fight Councilor Stevenson, seconded by Councilor Ferreira."
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": "00:15:41.320",
      "end": "00:15:42.850",
      "text": "All those in favor?"
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": "00:15:42.850",
      "end": "00:15:45.180",
      "text": "Motion carries."
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": "00:15:45.180",
      "end": "00:15:47.300",
      "text": "Thank you colleagues."
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": "00:15:47.300",
      "end": "00:15:51.340",
      "text": "We will see everyone back in 20 minutes for strategic priorities and policy committee."
    }
  ],
